	(text "INT1 is 3.3 V; Q1201 (gate at 3V3, 10k pull-up each side) shifts it to the Nano 5 V logic on D2 (net IMU_INT_5V). Polarity and push-pull / open-drain are set in the IMU INT_CONFIG register; TP1201 is the 3.3 V side."
